重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-22","generatedAt","2026-11-22T00:00:44.006Z","lead",{"_54":118,"_224":218},"leadItemId","jbitkvf4i6iewvak8ejgx9cvb","overview","highlights",[221,222,223],"sections",[185,186,187],"flashes",[165],"cover",{"_158":159,"_160":161,"_162":-5,"_163":-5,"_164":-5},"metrics",{"_153":53,"_154":49,"_155":156,"_157":156},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased",0,"firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/2d1376c3e7259e13.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/6c0de51a98256b9b.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/cb2aee1591fc7af0.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/2d1376c3e7259e13.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_166":167,"_54":168,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_173":174,"_175":176,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},"itemId","iepvrh0cnji8gnmctayok0ho0","Rackspace Spot 云平台遭入侵，攻击者读取客户 Kubernetes Secrets","summary","攻击者使用泄露凭据入侵 Rackspace Spot 云平台，在部分客户组织中以合法用户身份创建 Kubernetes Pod、读取 Secrets，并列出节点和卷，受害凭据可能包括密码、认证令牌、API 密钥及 Spot API 令牌。","sourceName","BleepingComputer","sourceUrl","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/rackspace-spot-breach-let-hackers-access-customer-kubernetes-secrets/","publishedAt","2026-11-21T22:59:58.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,{"_188":215,"_169":-5,"_190":216},{"_188":201,"_169":-5,"_190":202},{"_188":189,"_169":-5,"_190":191},"label","研究与披露","items",[192],{"_166":193,"_54":194,"_169":195,"_171":196,"_173":197,"_175":198,"_177":199,"_179":200,"_181":182,"_183":184},"dfh23lubzfof7rir61cxf0nq4","NebuSec 演示恶意网页劫持 Meta Muse 并读取私人聊天与记忆","NebuSec 演示恶意网页可绕过审批提示，从 Meta Muse 云端机器提取并篡改用户聊天记录与存储记忆，并结合内置浏览器和 Linux 内核缺陷取得机器控制权，访问凭据存储、保存文件及 Sentinel。攻击仅影响单台云端机器，未进入共享服务器或其他用户设备；研究为实验室演示，NebuSec 称所披露弱点均已修复，但 Meta 尚未公开确认，补丁发布前是否有用户数据被访问也未说明。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/a-single-malicious-webpage-let.html","2026-11-21T11:53:07.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","攻击与威胁",[203,204],{"_166":210,"_54":211,"_169":212,"_171":172,"_173":213,"_175":214,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_166":205,"_54":206,"_169":207,"_171":172,"_173":208,"_175":209,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},"dbml5ujd9k2y3agezdbxfdnmx","BADBOX 3.0 botnet 回归，每日发起 40 亿次欺诈广告竞价请求","HUMAN 的 Satori 研究人员发现 BADBOX 3.0 通过受感染的 Android 设备每日发起约 40 billion 次欺诈广告竞价请求，峰值占其观察到的 CTV 流量的 4% 以上。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/badbox-30-botnet-returns-with-record-breaking-40-billion-daily-ad-requests/","2026-11-21T15:17:27.000Z","lwn1awdsmrazlhsmt4r21vq0w","Microsoft Entra Connect Health 漏洞遭利用，租户数据被未授权访问","攻击者利用 Microsoft Entra Connect Health API 漏洞，未授权读取租户级元数据，并可能修改 Connect Health 监控配置。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/microsoft-entra-connect-health-flaw-exploited-to-steal-tenant-data/","2026-11-21T18:01:58.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[217],{"_166":138,"_54":118,"_169":218,"_171":196,"_173":219,"_175":220,"_177":199,"_179":200,"_181":182,"_183":184},"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 的 4 个漏洞列入 KEV，依据是已发现活跃利用证据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-critical-vmware-cisco.html","2026-11-21T08:49:13.000Z",{"_166":210,"_54":211,"_169":212,"_171":172,"_173":213,"_175":214,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_166":205,"_54":206,"_169":207,"_171":172,"_173":208,"_175":209,"_177":178,"_179":180,"_181":182,"_183":184},{"_166":193,"_54":194,"_169":195,"_171":196,"_173":197,"_175":198,"_177":199,"_179":200,"_181":182,"_183":184},"leadParagraph",{"_226":227,"_228":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
